        "TileImage": "$($repository ef82b4c5-240e-4da3-8b48-4fd37403e159).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Haven Island, where the sun is warm, the water is crystal clear, and survival depends on your ability to swim.\r\rAs the resort’s Snorkel Instructor, I offer every guest a simple lesson: &quot;Stay calm, follow instructions and keep your head above water. Those who fail will discover that the ocean is far less forgiving than I am.\r\rJoshua21",
